<!DOCTYPE html><html  lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Finance Payment Request workflow | StackOS</title><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/_og/s/o_yru507.png"><meta name="twitter:image:src" content="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/_og/s/o_yru507.png"><meta property="og:image" content="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/_og/s/o_yru507.png"><meta property="og:image:type" content="image/png"><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta name="twitter:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="600"><meta name="twitter:image:height" content="600"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/entry.HVu_FLFq.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/_slug_.CwWTwHW3.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/GeneratedVisual.Cf-hdjOs.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/WorkflowMap.DZrXaqny.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/CatalogCard.CZo9PXiI.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/LibraryFrame.CD2pOTex.css" crossorigin><link rel="preload" href="/fonts/manrope-latin-variable.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous"><link rel="preload" as="fetch" crossorigin="anonymous" href="/library/workflows/finance-payment-request/_payload.json?aa586fb3-d485-480b-909f-6b016269cb06"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/CHhb2Wy-.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/v-JSAWY_.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/DLjPO0uC.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/C3IxpUh1.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/DGV9g2y9.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/C4_Tu-xR.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/DHOT6Yra.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/B6FA65gX.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/Df8p5hZf.js"><script type="module" src="/_nuxt/CHhb2Wy-.js" crossorigin></script><link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/stackos-icon.png"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/images/stackos-icon.png"><link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="StackOS Library" href="/feed.xml"><meta name="description" content="One external payment request linked to a safe Stripe invoice reference, with deterministic mutation recovery and separate owner-approved finalization and send gates; an instructed no-send…"><meta name="theme-color" content="#090b10"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:title" content="Finance Payment Request workflow | StackOS"><meta property="og:description" content="One external payment request linked to a safe Stripe invoice reference, with deterministic mutation recovery and separate owner-approved finalization and send gates; an instructed no-send…"><meta name="twitter:title" content="Finance Payment Request workflow | StackOS"><meta name="twitter:description" content="One external payment request linked to a safe Stripe invoice reference, with deterministic mutation recovery and separate owner-approved finalization and send gates; an instructed no-send…"><meta name="robots" content="index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1"><link rel="canonical" href="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/library/workflows/finance-payment-request/"><meta property="og:url" content="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/library/workflows/finance-payment-request/"><meta property="og:site_name" content="StackOS"><script id="unhead:payload" type="application/json">{"titleTemplate":"%s | StackOS"}</script></head><body><div id="__nuxt"><!--[--><div id="top" class="site library-site" data-v-7c241740 data-v-e230b581><a class="skip-link" href="#main" data-v-e230b581>Skip to content</a><header class="site-header" data-v-e230b581><div class="shell site-header__inner"><a href="/" class="brand" aria-label="StackOS home"><img src="/images/stackos-icon.png" alt width="36" height="36"><span>StackOS</span><small>Work, organized</small></a><nav class="site-nav site-nav--desktop" aria-label="Primary"><a href="/#why" class="">Why StackOS</a><a href="/#workflow" class="">Workflows</a><a href="/#proof" class="">Product</a><a href="/getting-started/" class="">Get started</a><a href="/library/" class="">Library</a><a href="/#security" class="">Security</a><a class="button button--header" href="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/StackOS/stackos-latest-mac-arm64.dmg" data-download="stackos-mac"><img class="button__logo button__logo--apple" src="/images/apple.webp" alt="" width="18" height="18"> Download for Mac <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></nav><details class="mobile-menu"><summary role="button" aria-label="Toggle navigation" aria-controls="site-navigation"><span></span><span></span></summary><nav id="site-navigation" class="site-nav site-nav--mobile" aria-label="Primary"><a href="/#why" class="">Why StackOS</a><a href="/#workflow" class="">Workflows</a><a href="/#proof" class="">Product</a><a href="/getting-started/" class="">Get started</a><a href="/library/" class="">Library</a><a href="/#security" class="">Security</a><a class="button button--header" href="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/StackOS/stackos-latest-mac-arm64.dmg" data-download="stackos-mac"><img class="button__logo button__logo--apple" src="/images/apple.webp" alt="" width="18" height="18"> Download for Mac <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></nav></details></div></header><div class="library-nav" aria-label="Library sections" data-v-e230b581><div class="shell library-nav__inner" data-v-e230b581><a href="/library/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Library</a><a href="/library/workflows/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Workflows</a><a href="/library/agents/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Agents</a><a href="/library/orchestrators/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Orchestrators</a><a href="/library/integrations/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Integrations</a><a href="/library/articles/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Articles</a></div></div><main id="main" class="library-main" data-v-e230b581><nav class="library-breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb" data-v-e230b581 data-v-59391fa3><div class="shell" data-v-59391fa3><ol data-v-59391fa3><!--[--><li data-v-59391fa3><a href="/" class="" data-v-59391fa3>Home</a></li><li data-v-59391fa3><a href="/library/" class="" data-v-59391fa3>Library</a></li><li data-v-59391fa3><a href="/library/workflows/" class="" data-v-59391fa3>Workflows</a></li><li data-v-59391fa3><a aria-current="page" href="/library/workflows/finance-payment-request/" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active" data-v-59391fa3>Finance Payment Request</a></li><!--]--></ol></div></nav><!--[--><section class="detail-hero" data-v-7c241740><div class="shell detail-hero__grid" data-v-7c241740><div data-v-7c241740><p class="library-kicker" data-v-7c241740>Solo entrepreneurs issuing a reviewed Stripe invoice from an external payment-request record / finance</p><h1 data-v-7c241740>Finance Payment Request</h1><p class="detail-hero__lede" data-v-7c241740>One external payment request linked to a safe Stripe invoice reference, with deterministic mutation recovery and separate owner-approved finalization and send gates; an instructed no-send…</p><div class="detail-tags" data-v-7c241740><span data-v-7c241740>7 stages</span><span data-v-7c241740>2 specialist agents</span><span data-v-7c241740>Connection required</span></div></div><div class="generated-visual generated-visual--workflow detail-hero__visual" style="--visual-color:#d9ff63;" role="img" aria-label="A complete plan you can follow. Finance Payment Request. From request to result." data-v-7c241740 data-v-9361e887><header class="generated-visual__header" data-v-9361e887><div data-v-9361e887><span data-v-9361e887>From request to result</span><strong data-v-9361e887>A complete plan you can follow.</strong></div><small data-v-9361e887>Visible plan</small></header><div class="generated-visual__lane" aria-hidden="true" data-v-9361e887><div class="visual-node visual-node--clients" data-v-9361e887><span class="visual-node__label" data-v-9361e887>Start in your AI</span><div class="client-list" data-v-9361e887><!--[--><span class="client-chip" data-v-9361e887><img src="/images/openai.webp" alt="" width="34" height="34" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-9361e887><b data-v-9361e887>Codex</b></span><span class="client-chip" data-v-9361e887><img src="/images/claude.webp" alt="" width="34" height="34" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-9361e887><b data-v-9361e887>Claude</b></span><span class="client-chip" data-v-9361e887><img src="/images/gemini.webp" alt="" width="34" height="34" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-9361e887><b data-v-9361e887>Gemini</b></span><!--]--></div></div><i class="visual-connector" data-v-9361e887><span data-v-9361e887></span></i><div class="visual-node visual-node--stackos" data-v-9361e887><img src="/images/stackos-icon.png" alt="" width="42" height="42" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-9361e887><strong data-v-9361e887>StackOS</strong><small data-v-9361e887>Builds the plan</small></div><i class="visual-connector" data-v-9361e887><span data-v-9361e887></span></i><div class="visual-node visual-node--outcome" data-v-9361e887><span class="visual-node__label" data-v-9361e887>Visible stages</span><div class="outcome-list" data-v-9361e887><!--[--><span data-v-9361e887><b data-v-9361e887>1</b> Plan</span><span data-v-9361e887><b data-v-9361e887>2</b> Do</span><span data-v-9361e887><b data-v-9361e887>3</b> Check</span><!--]--></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="detail-body" data-v-7c241740><div class="detail-body__narrow" data-v-7c241740><p class="eyebrow" data-v-7c241740>The problem</p><h2 data-v-7c241740>Sending an invoice is repetitive, but a draft, finalization, customer delivery, recovery, and external records must remain distinguishable.</h2><p class="detail-body__intro" data-v-7c241740>An agent can prepare a bounded Stripe invoice from the selected external record while enforcing idempotency, separating draft work from customer delivery, and preserving owner decisions.</p></div><div class="shell experience-grid" data-v-7c241740><article data-v-7c241740><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark" data-v-7c241740>What you do</p><ol data-v-7c241740><!--[--><li data-v-7c241740>Request an invoice from the external billing record; the agent resolves workspace defaults and prepares the draft.</li><li data-v-7c241740>Review the independently retrieved customer and invoice facts. For visual review, locate the saved draft in Stripe Dashboard and check whether its overflow Download PDF action works for this invoice/account; StackOS has no draft PDF API URL or stable Dashboard deep link. Approve finalization and customer send as separate decisions, or one exact-version decision recorded under both technical gates.</li><li data-v-7c241740>Inspect a safe provider result, exception, or recovery recommendation; never provide customer data or payment instructions in chat.</li><!--]--></ol></article><article data-v-7c241740><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark" data-v-7c241740>What the agent does</p><ol data-v-7c241740><!--[--><li data-v-7c241740>Preflight one external payment request and resolve only safe account-bound Stripe references.</li><li data-v-7c241740>Discover approved existing catalog choices when needed, then create/reconcile a draft customer, invoice, and invoice item with deterministic idempotency keys.</li><li data-v-7c241740>Use action-level owner approvals for finalize and send; a standing policy is guidance and cannot waive either technical gate.</li><li data-v-7c241740>Write safe provider/status/proof refs back to the selected external backend and hand sent/open invoices or an instructed finalized no-send settlement to follow-up work when appropriate.</li><!--]--></ol></article></div><div class="detail-body__narrow detail-space" data-v-7c241740><p class="eyebrow" data-v-7c241740>When this workflow helps</p><h2 data-v-7c241740>A reusable method, adapted to the request.</h2><ul class="detail-list" data-v-7c241740><!--[--><li data-v-7c241740>A single approved external payment request needs a Stripe draft invoice, finalization, and customer delivery.</li><!--]--></ul></div><div class="shell readiness-grid" data-v-7c241740><article data-v-7c241740><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark" data-v-7c241740>Before it starts</p><h3 data-v-7c241740>Connection required</h3><ul data-v-7c241740><!--[--><li data-v-7c241740>A restricted Stripe connection with the invoice route selected</li><li data-v-7c241740>A selected workspace and one billing-request reference resolving an immutable external version with customer, lines, currency and terms</li><li data-v-7c241740>Explicit owner approval of the concrete draft before finalization and send; existing exact-scope decisions are verified and recorded without requesting approval again</li><!--]--></ul></article><article data-v-7c241740><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark" data-v-7c241740>What proves it worked</p><h3 data-v-7c241740>Evidence, not a success claim.</h3><ul data-v-7c241740><!--[--><li data-v-7c241740>Safe external payment-request and Stripe invoice/customer refs</li><li data-v-7c241740>Action-call/provider request refs, idempotency/reconciliation status, and owner approval refs</li><li data-v-7c241740>External backend write proof and workflow handoff refs</li><!--]--></ul></article></div><div class="shell workflow-showcase" data-v-7c241740><div class="library-section__heading" data-v-7c241740><div data-v-7c241740><p class="eyebrow" data-v-7c241740>Workflow path</p><h2 data-v-7c241740>The reusable stages of the work.</h2></div><p data-v-7c241740>A real run expands these stages around the request, context, selected tools, approvals, and dependencies.</p></div><section class="workflow-map" style="--workflow-color:#8ea6ff;" aria-labelledby="workflow-map-title" data-v-7c241740 data-v-110563eb><header data-v-110563eb><span class="status-dot" data-v-110563eb></span><strong id="workflow-map-title" data-v-110563eb>7 ordered workflow stages</strong></header><ol aria-label="Workflow stages" data-v-110563eb><!--[--><li data-workflow-stage data-v-110563eb><span data-v-110563eb>01</span><div data-v-110563eb><h3 data-v-110563eb>Preflight External Request And Stripe Route</h3><p data-v-110563eb>Resolve one immutable billing request and workspace billing/customer-mapping rules.</p></div><small data-v-110563eb>Passes to next stage</small></li><li data-workflow-stage data-v-110563eb><span data-v-110563eb>02</span><div data-v-110563eb><h3 data-v-110563eb>Resolve Or Create Customer</h3><p data-v-110563eb>Reconcile an approved external customer to a safe account-bound Stripe customer ref.</p></div><small data-v-110563eb>Passes to next stage</small></li><li data-workflow-stage data-v-110563eb><span data-v-110563eb>03</span><div data-v-110563eb><h3 data-v-110563eb>Create Or Reconcile Draft Invoice</h3><p data-v-110563eb>Prepare the approved external request as a Stripe draft invoice and item without finalizing or sending.</p></div><small data-v-110563eb>Passes to next stage</small></li><li data-workflow-stage data-v-110563eb><span data-v-110563eb>04</span><div data-v-110563eb><h3 data-v-110563eb>Review Draft And Required Owner Gates</h3><p data-v-110563eb>Confirm external request consistency and make finalization/send approvals available to their exact action contracts.</p></div><small data-v-110563eb>Passes to next stage</small></li><li data-workflow-stage data-v-110563eb><span data-v-110563eb>05</span><div data-v-110563eb><h3 data-v-110563eb>Finalize Approved Invoice</h3><p data-v-110563eb>Run only the owner-approved Stripe finalization action and reconcile unknown outcomes with reads.</p></div><small data-v-110563eb>Passes to next stage</small></li><li data-workflow-stage data-v-110563eb><span data-v-110563eb>06</span><div data-v-110563eb><h3 data-v-110563eb>Send Approved Invoice</h3><p data-v-110563eb>Execute the approved API send or reconcile independently verified prior manual delivery without another send.</p></div><small data-v-110563eb>Passes to next stage</small></li><li data-workflow-stage data-v-110563eb><span data-v-110563eb>07</span><div data-v-110563eb><h3 data-v-110563eb>Record External Status And Handoff</h3><p data-v-110563eb>Record safe Stripe outcome refs in the selected external backend and hand eligible open invoices or instructed no-send settlement work to follow-up.</p></div><small data-v-110563eb>Verified outcome</small></li><!--]--></ol></section></div><div class="detail-body__narrow" style="margin-top:88px;" data-v-7c241740><!--[--><p class="eyebrow" data-v-7c241740>Safe stopping and recovery</p><h2 data-v-7c241740>Useful even when the whole path cannot run.</h2><ul class="detail-list" data-v-7c241740><!--[--><li data-v-7c241740>Stop with a draft/reconciliation recommendation before finalization when approval is not recorded.</li><li data-v-7c241740>Stop after finalization but before send when the send gate is absent, delivery outcome is uncertain, or the external record instructs a separate settlement-only attachment.</li><!--]--><!--[--><li data-v-7c241740>For an unknown write outcome, retrieve/reconcile the same safe provider refs with the same deterministic key; never create a new key or duplicate customer/invoice/item.</li><li data-v-7c241740>If approval is absent, stop at the review-ready draft and do not finalize or send.</li><li data-v-7c241740>If direct-deposit-only Pay online absence or a required visual draft review cannot be verified, hold the draft and report the specific Dashboard/manual-review gap. Stripe documents a Dashboard Email invoice without link option and a general Download PDF action; verify both for the selected account and invoice before relying on them. Never finalize merely to obtain a review PDF or link.</li><!--]--></ul><!--]--><!--[--><p class="eyebrow detail-space" data-v-7c241740>Documented follow-on work</p><h2 data-v-7c241740>The next workflow is conditional, not hidden.</h2><div class="handoff-list" data-v-7c241740><!--[--><a href="/library/workflows/finance-payment-request-followups/" class="" data-v-7c241740><span data-v-7c241740>next</span><strong data-v-7c241740>Finance Payment Request Follow-Ups</strong><p data-v-7c241740>A safely recorded sent/open invoice is eligible for follow-up policy evaluation, or a finalized invoice has an instructed known-payment settlement-only attachment.</p></a><a href="/library/workflows/finance-bookkeeping-close/" class="" data-v-7c241740><span data-v-7c241740>conditional</span><strong data-v-7c241740>Finance Bookkeeping Preparation and Reconciliation</strong><p data-v-7c241740>Safe invoice lifecycle evidence must be prepared/matched in the external backend.</p></a><!--]--></div><!--]--><!--[--><p class="eyebrow detail-space" data-v-7c241740>Specialists inside this workflow</p><h2 data-v-7c241740>Clear roles for each part of the job.</h2><div class="detail-link-grid" data-v-7c241740><!--[--><a href="/library/agents/stackos-finance-billing-collections-operator/" class="" data-v-7c241740><span data-v-7c241740>Agent</span><strong data-v-7c241740>Finance Billing and Collections Operator</strong><b aria-hidden="true" data-v-7c241740>→</b></a><a href="/library/agents/stackos-finance-control-reviewer/" class="" data-v-7c241740><span data-v-7c241740>Agent</span><strong data-v-7c241740>Finance Control Reviewer</strong><b aria-hidden="true" data-v-7c241740>→</b></a><!--]--></div><!--]--><!--[--><p class="eyebrow detail-space" data-v-7c241740>Connected work</p><h2 data-v-7c241740>Built to use the tools you already have.</h2><div class="detail-tags detail-tags--paper" data-v-7c241740><!--[--><span data-v-7c241740>Stripe</span><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><section class="related-section" data-v-7c241740><div class="shell" data-v-7c241740><div class="library-section__heading" data-v-7c241740><div data-v-7c241740><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark" data-v-7c241740>Keep exploring</p><h2 data-v-7c241740>Related workflows.</h2></div><a href="/library/workflows/" class="" data-v-7c241740>See all 36 →</a></div><div class="library-grid" data-v-7c241740><!--[--><a href="/library/workflows/finance-bookkeeping-close/" class="catalog-card" style="--card-color:#8ea6ff;" data-v-7c241740 data-v-661e3dea><div class="catalog-card__visual" aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea><!--[--><span data-v-661e3dea></span><i data-v-661e3dea></i><span data-v-661e3dea></span><i data-v-661e3dea></i><span data-v-661e3dea></span><!--]--></div><div class="catalog-card__meta" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>workflow</span><b data-v-661e3dea>finance</b></div><h3 data-v-661e3dea>Finance Bookkeeping Preparation and Reconciliation</h3><p data-v-661e3dea>A reviewed, externally recorded close packet marked prepared/unposted, with matched and exception refs that can be handed to later workflows.</p><div class="catalog-card__footer" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>5 stages</span><b aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea>↗</b></div></a><a href="/library/workflows/finance-cashflow-management/" class="catalog-card" style="--card-color:#8ea6ff;" data-v-7c241740 data-v-661e3dea><div class="catalog-card__visual" aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea><!--[--><span data-v-661e3dea></span><i data-v-661e3dea></i><span data-v-661e3dea></span><i data-v-661e3dea></i><span data-v-661e3dea></span><!--]--></div><div class="catalog-card__meta" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>workflow</span><b data-v-661e3dea>finance</b></div><h3 data-v-661e3dea>Finance Cashflow Management</h3><p data-v-661e3dea>A dated external thirteen-week forecast packet with safe evidence/proof refs, uncertainty, exception state, and tax-estimate handoff readiness.</p><div class="catalog-card__footer" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>4 stages</span><b aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea>↗</b></div></a><a href="/library/workflows/finance-payment-request-followups/" class="catalog-card" style="--card-color:#8ea6ff;" data-v-7c241740 data-v-661e3dea><div class="catalog-card__visual" aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea><!--[--><span data-v-661e3dea></span><i data-v-661e3dea></i><span data-v-661e3dea></span><i data-v-661e3dea></i><span data-v-661e3dea></span><!--]--></div><div class="catalog-card__meta" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>workflow</span><b data-v-661e3dea>finance</b></div><h3 data-v-661e3dea>Finance Payment Request Follow-Ups</h3><p data-v-661e3dea>A safe external follow-up or settlement decision record. Every invoice is suppressed, exception-bound, or eligible for one instructed contact through the selected Stripe resend or SMTP…</p><div class="catalog-card__footer" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>9 stages</span><b aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea>↗</b></div></a><!--]--></div></div></section><!--]--></main><footer class="site-footer" data-v-e230b581 data-v-5f58f905><div class="shell site-footer__grid" data-v-5f58f905><a href="/" class="footer-brand" data-v-5f58f905><img src="/images/stackos-icon.png" alt width="42" height="42" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-5f58f905><div data-v-5f58f905><strong data-v-5f58f905>StackOS</strong><span data-v-5f58f905>Keep AI-powered work clear, connected, and moving.</span></div></a><div class="site-footer__links" data-v-5f58f905><div data-v-5f58f905><span data-v-5f58f905>Explore</span><a href="/#why" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Why StackOS</a><a href="/getting-started/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Getting started</a><a href="/library/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Library</a><a href="/library/workflows/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Workflows</a><a href="/library/articles/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Articles</a></div><div data-v-5f58f905><span data-v-5f58f905>Build</span><a href="/#security" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Security</a><a href